# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# core.autocrlf. Without this, Windows checkout (autocrlf=true) lands files on
# disk as CRLF, which prettier's default endOfLine:lf flags as false "drift"
# locally while CI (Linux, LF) stays green. eol=lf keeps local == CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
